@startuml 008-mode-timed-scoring-component
title 008 mode-timed-scoring：組件圖

package "web" {
  [Teacher RoundControls\n開放下一題・提早結束・揭曉本題・倒數] as TRound
  [Teacher QuestionList\n每題時限（preparing、時間計分）] as TList
  [StudentPanel\n只顯示進行中題目・倒數\n揭曉結果・排行榜] as SPage
  [api.ts] as Api
}

package "server/quiz_server" {
  [app.py\nPOST open-next・close-question\nreveal-question・question-settings(time_limit)] as App
  [modes\nMode.sequential・timed] as Modes
  [activity.Activity\nrounds・open_next・close_due\nreveal_question・可注入 clock] as Act
  [計時器任務\n迴圈：sleep 剩餘時間 -> close_due()\n直到該回合關閉] as Timer
  [scoring\nTimedRule・timed_points] as Scoring
  [views\nround・revealed（本組）・leaderboard（學生只有名次）] as Views
  [results\nrevealed_scores・leaderboard・own_revealed] as Results
}

TRound --> Api
TList --> Api
SPage --> Api
Api --> App
App --> Act
Act --> Modes
Act --> Timer : open_next 時排程
Timer --> Act : close_due()
Views --> Results
Results --> Scoring : 只計已揭曉題
App --> Views

note right of Act
  截止判斷在 submit 內以 clock 比對；
  計時器只決定何時推送「已關閉」
end note
@enduml
